{
  "components": [
    {
      "id": "webhook_1",
      "provider": "webhook",
      "config": {
        "hideForm": true,
        "mode": "Source",
        "parameters": {},
        "type": "webhook"
      },
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 20,
          "y": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_rocketride_1",
      "provider": "agent_rocketride",
      "config": {
        "agent_description": "Nous find-slot: Guild Calendar read → propose free slot → FalkorDB + LaserData. Read-only calendar.",
        "instructions": [
          "You find one free calendar slot for a commitment. READ calendar only. Never create/update/delete events. Never call create_event.",
          "Expected input: {correlation_id, commitment_id?, person, window_start, window_end, activity?}.",
          "1) Validate window_start/window_end ISO-8601; preserve correlation_id and optional commitment_id.",
          "2) Call tool_guild (nous-calendar-reader) with check_availability for that window. Collect conflicts.",
          "3) Propose one free slot inside the window that avoids conflicts. Shape proposed_slot as {start, end, person, activity, title} (activity defaults to visit/meet with person).",
          "4) If commitment_id is present: write proposed_slot onto the Commitment and related Action in FalkorDB personal_brain (allow_writes). Do not invent commitment rows if missing — return failed with reason missing_commitment.",
          "5) Remember the proposal JSON in LaserData namespace nous:life-events (include correlation_id, commitment_id?, proposed_slot, conflicts, source:find_slot).",
          "6) Return JSON only:",
          "{\"status\":\"slot_proposed\",\"proposed_slot\":{...},\"conflicts\":[...],\"correlation_id\":\"...\",\"commitment_id\":\"...\"}"
        ],
        "max_waves": 10,
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "questions",
          "from": "webhook_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "llm_openai_1",
      "provider": "llm_openai",
      "config": {
        "profile": "openai-4o-mini",
        "openai-4o-mini": {
          "apikey": "${ROCKETRIDE_OPENAI_KEY}"
        },
        "parameters": {}
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "llm",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        },
        {
          "classType": "llm",
          "from": "graph_falkordb_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 20
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory_internal_1",
      "provider": "memory_internal",
      "config": {
        "type": "memory_internal"
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "memory",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 380
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_guild_1",
      "provider": "tool_guild",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_guild",
        "baseUrl": "https://app.guild.ai",
        "apiKeyId": "${GUILD_API_KEY_ID}",
        "apiKeySecret": "${GUILD_API_KEY_SECRET}",
        "owner": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_OWNER}",
        "workspace": "${GUILD_WORKSPACE_NAME}",
        "agent": "nous-calendar-reader",
        "resultMode": "wait",
        "timeout": 300,
        "maxSessions": 5,
        "verifyTls": true
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "tool",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 40
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "graph_falkordb_1",
      "provider": "graph_falkordb",
      "config": {
        "type": "graph_falkordb",
        "host": "${FALKOR_HOST}",
        "port": 6379,
        "username": "${FALKOR_USERNAME}",
        "password": "${FALKOR_PASSWORD}",
        "tls": false,
        "graph": "personal_brain",
        "db_description": "Nous personal brain graph: write proposed_slot onto Commitment/Action when commitment_id present.",
        "allow_writes": true,
        "allow_execute": true,
        "max_attempts": 5,
        "max_rows": 250,
        "max_execute_rows": 25000,
        "query_timeout_ms": 30000
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "tool",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tool_laserdata_memory_1",
      "provider": "tool_laserdata_memory",
      "config": {
        "type": "tool_laserdata_memory",
        "profile": "cloud",
        "cloud": {
          "connection_string": "${LASER_CONNECTION_STRING}",
          "namespace": "nous:life-events",
          "show_advanced": true,
          "stream": "nous",
          "allow_namespace_override": false,
          "folded": true,
          "recall_limit": 20,
          "op_timeout": 30
        }
      },
      "control": [
        {
          "classType": "tool",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 520,
          "y": 360
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "response_answers_1",
      "provider": "response_answers",
      "config": {
        "laneName": "result"
      },
      "input": [
        {
          "lane": "answers",
          "from": "agent_rocketride_1"
        }
      ],
      "ui": {
        "position": {
          "x": 760,
          "y": 200
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "description": "Guild Calendar read → propose free slot → FalkorDB proposed_slot + LaserData life-events",
  "project_id": "5e549971-2a03-4ae1-a60f-a13a8308fcf9",
  "viewport": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "zoom": 1
  },
  "version": 1
}